        Test emit functionality\ncomponent.vm.state[''onUpdate:selection'']([''item1'']);\nexpect(component.emitted(''update:selection'')).toBeTruthy();\nexpect(component.emitted(''update:selection'')?.[0]).toEqual([[''item1'']]);\n\t})\n```\n\n##
