        ''updated-value'');\n\n\t\texpect(otherValues.value[0]?.value).toBe(''updated-value'');\n\t\texpect(emit).toHaveBeenCalledWith([''option1'',
        ''updated-value'']);\n\t\tresolve(undefined);\n\t});\n});\n\t\t})\n```\n\n##
