        = null;\n    \t\t}\n    \t},\n    );\n\n    return { otherValue, usesOtherValue
        };\n}\n\nexport type OtherValue = {\n\tkey: string;\n\tvalue: string;\n\tfocus?:
        boolean;\n};\n\ntype UsableCustomSelectionMultiple = {\n\totherValues: Ref<OtherValue[]>;\n\taddOtherValue:
